# docs.senseikatana.com is retired: every legacy URL 301s to the canonical
# host. Absolute destinations, because the same deployment also serves the
# apexes through the docs proxy Worker — a relative redirect would keep users
# on the old host, and a `/*` catch-all would loop with /en/docs/* (the
# destination paths are deliberately not listed as sources).
/                https://senseikatana.com/en/docs/                     301
/docs/*          https://senseikatana.com/en/docs/:splat              301
/docs            https://senseikatana.com/en/docs/                     301
/tutorials/*     https://senseikatana.com/en/docs/tutorials/:splat     301
/guides/*        https://senseikatana.com/en/docs/guides/:splat        301
/ui-kit/*        https://senseikatana.com/en/docs/ui-kit/:splat        301
/api/*           https://senseikatana.com/en/docs/api/:splat           301
/explanation/*   https://senseikatana.com/en/docs/explanation/:splat   301
/changelog       https://senseikatana.com/en/docs/changelog            301
/hyperui/*       https://senseikatana.com/en/docs/hyperui/:splat       301
/images/*        https://senseikatana.com/en/docs/images/:splat        301
/component.css   https://senseikatana.com/en/docs/component.css        301
/component.js    https://senseikatana.com/en/docs/component.js         301
/robots.txt      https://senseikatana.com/en/docs/robots.txt           301
/sitemap.xml     https://senseikatana.com/en/docs/sitemap.xml          301

# The narrative pages moved from /guides/ to /start/ (Docs section).
/en/docs/guides/getting-started    /en/docs/start/getting-started    301
/en/docs/guides/errors             /en/docs/start/errors             301
/en/docs/guides/roadmap            /en/docs/start/roadmap            301
/en/docs/guides/architecture       /en/docs/start/architecture       301
